    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Challenge yourself in Stella Gladio, fast paced action precision plaformer! Play as Gladio, a daring adventurer, as you scale a mysterious tower with your witty companion\u2014a talking magic sword named Stella. Together, uncover the tower's secrets, conquer challenging obstacles, discover their bond, and reach the top of the tower.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanic:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to warp/blink toward Stella to reach otherwise inaccessible places. However, you must throw Stella first. Be careful\u2014once you throw Stella, you can\u2019t call her back. The only way forward is to move toward her, making it a one-way ticket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.poster.avif?t=1743412395\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.webm?t=1743412395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.mp4?t=1743412395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Challenge yourself in Stella Gladio, fast paced action precision plaformer! Play as Gladio, a daring adventurer, as you scale a mysterious tower with your witty companion\u2014a talking magic sword named Stella. Together, uncover the tower's secrets, conquer challenging obstacles, discover their bond, and reach the top of the tower.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanic:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to warp/blink toward Stella to reach otherwise inaccessible places. However, you must throw Stella first. Be careful\u2014once you throw Stella, you can\u2019t call her back. The only way forward is to move toward her, making it a one-way ticket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.poster.avif?t=1743412395\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.webm?t=1743412395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384490/extras/5f419ef9fba9b11199b05f0dd616d6af.mp4?t=1743412395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
